{'symbol': 'TT', 'date': '2022-07-01 08:30:00', 'title': 'THERMO KING® BY TRANE TECHNOLOGIES ACCELERATES ELECTRIFICATION INNOVATION IN EUROPE WITH NEW RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT CENTER', 'text': "SWORDS, IRELAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THERMO KING® BY TRANE TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: TT), A GLOBAL CLIMATE INNOVATOR, TODAY LAUNCHED A NEW RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT (R&D) CENTER ADJACENT TO ITS SUSTAINABLE MANUFACTURING OPERATIONS IN GALWAY, IRELAND. THE R&D CENTER, WITH CAPACITY FOR UP TO 70 ENGINEERS, ADDS TO THE COMPANY'S ELECTRIFICATION DESIGN AND ENGINEERING CAPABILITIES IN EUROPE, WHICH INCLUDES AN R&D CENTER IN ESSEN, GERMANY. IT IS PART OF THE COMPANY'S MORE THAN $100 MILLION INVESTME"}